<title>BELGIUM: SGB's Davignon to stay on for three more years.</title>
<headline>SGB's Davignon to stay on for three more years.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Etienne Davignon, chairman of Belgian holding company Societe Generale de Belgique SA (SGB), said on Wednesday he and SGB chief executive officer Philippe Liotier were due to stay on for another three years.</p>
<p>Davignon said SGB's board would propose to shareholders to re-new the two mandates for three more years.</p>
<p>Liotier is 65, Davignon 64.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
